							Wow, this thread sure evolved into something different, since I last saw it.<br /><br />Also, the last time I saw an &quot;apology&quot; that was that halfhearted , It involved a former president, and a blue dress.<br /><br />Honestly, if a child getting into their poopy diaper was a sign of abuse, then half the country is guilty of child abuse. Neither of mine did this particular thing, but the number of parents I know, who are good concerned parent, and have had this same problem, suggests that its not abuse related.<br /><br />But back on the topic of how to stop this, notice my suggestion was ONE PIECE pajamas. They are kinda like onesies, but have legs on them and little footies.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
