							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Moraganna, if your comment was directed at me, I stated before, I have three children.<br />(Two children stay with their mother, from previous marriage.)</div><br />No it wasn&#039;t directed at you. I was just stateing this for anyone without children that like to tell you how to be a parent. I didn&#039;t take a lot of what you had to say to heart. I agreed to a point but then I also understand from my own children that you can&#039;t watch them 24/7 without them getting into something with your back turned. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
